CLASS: CONTRACT
Last updated: 2026-08-25

# V2 plugin contract

- `plugins.v2/<plugin_id>/` owns V2-specific source, while `package.v2.json` owns its marketplace metadata because V2 resolves its dedicated index before compatible default-index entries.
- Apply `AGENTS.md`'s shared conventions to V2 identities, frontend entry points, and checks because cross-generation boilerplate has one home.
- Keep V2 implementations here when V3 has a distinct contract, and mark the old index entry `v3: false`, because V3 must not fall back to an incompatible implementation.
- Do not put centralized tests here; `tests/v2/<plugin_id>/` owns them because plugin directories are copied into installed runtime instances.

## Architecture record index

| record | pointer |
| --- | --- |
| Agent Resource Officer architecture | `plugins.v2/agentresourceofficer/ARCHITECTURE.md` |
| AI Recognizer Enhancer architecture | `plugins.v2/airecognizerenhancer/ARCHITECTURE.md` |

